{"reviews":[{"id":"B072Z6DWJM-0","r":1.0,"t":"Ingredient banned years ago by the FDA.","x":"All I'm going to say about this product is these have triclocarban and it has been banned by the FDA. I would not be able to post a review if I did not choose at least one star but it does not even deserve one star. I'm so sick of buying things off of Amazon that are either banned, dangerous, don't work or just all-around defective or old. Obviously there's absolutely no quality control in regard to the items they sell.","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2020"},{"id":"B072Z6DWJM-1","r":5.0,"t":"Great smelling soap!","x":"If you like lavender, you\u2019ll love this soap! It smells great yet is often very hard (if not impossible) to find in stores so it\u2019s great that amazon has it! It smells wonderful and is moisturizing yet still rinses cleanly leaving your skin feeling soft and clean without feeling greasy. Two thumbs up!","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B072Z6DWJM-2","r":5.0,"t":"Gentle  enough for your intimate parts","x":"This scent is amazing! Perfect for cleansing and staying fresh! Not harsh on your skin!!","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2018"},{"id":"B072Z6DWJM-3","r":4.0,"t":"Moisturizing","x":"Smells super feminine, and leathers thick oh yeah!! The bar its self is so cute too purple eekk and the texture is pleasing to touch. Probably wouldn't last very long so good thing it comes with as many bars as it does. The clean feeling you get and it makes the shower smell LOVELY","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B072Z6DWJM-4","r":5.0,"t":"I'm a fan!","x":"Best barred soap on the market.  Smells great and leaves skin moisturized.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"May 2018"},{"id":"B072Z6DWJM-5","r":5.0,"t":"You need soap and water, soap and water Soap and water, soap and water ... ANTIBACTERIAL Y'ALL","x":"What can I say? This soap CLEANS... Like for REAL cleans... Not just slapping suds and fragrance on your body to kinda clean off the funk and MASK odors... It DEEP cleans like the stinkiest parts of your swampy stank areas.  Oh yes, it's antibacterial too. I don't care who you are or how sweaty or not sweaty you get.... Everyone has some no go zone that gets je ne sais quoi .... Armpits, butt crack, feet, in between toes, groin area sweat, behind the ears...  All those other frilly soaps and bod","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B072Z6DWJM-6","r":2.0,"t":"Disappointed","x":"I was looking forward to the strong lavenday fragrance but unfortunately there is barely any fragrance. So disappointed as this is why I bought the soap.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B072Z6DWJM-7","r":4.0,"t":"Four Stars","x":"Dail deodorant soap power with a nice lavender scent.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2018"},{"id":"B072Z6DWJM-8","r":4.0,"t":"Can't buy this scent locally - I do a lot ...","x":"Can't buy this scent locally - I do a lot of work in the yard and the lavender scent seems to help keep bugs away","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2018"},{"id":"B072Z6DWJM-9","r":1.0,"t":"One Star","x":"This soap product smells more like chemicals than lavender and/or jasmine. Disappointed.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2018"},{"id":"B072Z6DWJM-10","r":1.0,"t":"Horrible product","x":"Terrible soap. For a start this is way too big and it has an awkward shape.  It arrived kind of melted and stuck to its package. It made my skin feel like rubber and it is not moisturizing  at ll. It makes the skin feels weird and dry.  I normally use the brand with the bird name and that does not melt in shower after 2 uses. This one breaks and melts leaving the surface of the soap holder a mess. I did not like and I do not recommend.  I bought it because it is antibacterial and also because I ","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2020"},{"id":"B072Z6DWJM-11","r":5.0,"t":"I got my money's worth!","x":"I've always been a huge fan of Dial soaps. This is a scent that I'd never seen in my local store and was eager to give it a try.  It still has the cleaning power of the gold Dial while leaving my skin smelling very feminine. I get the best of both worlds! I haven't run out yet, but when I do I will stock up on more.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B072Z6DWJM-12","r":5.0,"t":"I highly recommend this soap to anyone with acne","x":"Waooo,Just now I realized that this soap is antibacterial!!!! That's why it cleared up my acne! I bought it by mistake at Walmart and started using it and my skin is now flawless! I highly recommend this soap to anyone with acne!!!!","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Mar 2018"},{"id":"B072Z6DWJM-13","r":3.0,"t":"Meh, not the scent I imagined","x":"The scent through the packaging was delish! However, the scent is extremely weak in the shower \ud83d\udebf. It is a solid bar, not glycerin (not transparent) but the scent is deceiving and weak; but good lather if you are using spa gloves","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B072Z6DWJM-14","r":5.0,"t":"Thoroughly cleanses skin","x":"Lathers and rinses well. Very moisturizing. One of the best bar soaps I ever used. Soap arrived in with the wrapper torn and soaps all over but considering the climate these days I am thankful to have received the product","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2020"},{"id":"B072Z6DWJM-15","r":5.0,"t":"Strong but a good strong","x":"I like Dial so I thought I would give a new smell a go. I love lavender however the flowery smell of the other could of been left out. I like it but I will go back to my lavender bars once these are gone.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B072Z6DWJM-16","r":5.0,"t":"Can\u2019t find in store","x":"I read where lavender repels ticks but can\u2019t find lavender soap in the store. This was a good price and nice smell and since using it only have had 1 tick. Will purchase again.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B072Z6DWJM-17","r":3.0,"t":"Nah","x":"Scent nice, really makes my skin dry.  The soap bar design is bad(the bar with the half moon on one side that desolves really unevenly), will not purchase again.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2019"},{"id":"B072Z6DWJM-18","r":4.0,"t":"The quickest dissipating soap","x":"Scent was fine, almost got that squeaky clean feeling.  However, for some reason these bars dissipate really quickly compared to other soap bars I've purchased.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B072Z6DWJM-19","r":5.0,"t":"Nice scent!","x":"Beautiful lavender colored soap with a very nice scent. Really like the color and the scent. Not too heavy or overpowering. Looks nice in any bathroom too!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2018"},{"id":"B072Z6DWJM-20","r":5.0,"t":"Wonderful hand soap option.","x":"Perfect hand soap for kitchen and bathrooms. Long lasting. Smells great and kills germs. Much cheaper option than bottled hand soaps. Does the job!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B072Z6DWJM-21","r":5.0,"t":"Love this soap!","x":"I have used this soap for years and love the smell. However, it's impossible to find it locally, so of course, Amazon to the rescue!!!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B072Z6DWJM-22","r":1.0,"t":"NOT typical Dial Soap Quality","x":"Didn\u2019t seem like a typical Dial product. Strange texture and smell. Almost like it\u2019s reject soap bars. Other Dial soaps more vibrant.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B072Z6DWJM-23","r":4.0,"t":"Love the smell","x":"A friend of mines gave me this soap I use it from head to toe I love it and it doesn't make me feel itchy will be buying more.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B072Z6DWJM-24","r":3.0,"t":"Average","x":"Is a bit too harsh on the skin and while when dry it smells very good, when you wash your hands with it the smell disappears","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2020"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers praise the lavender scent as pleasant and feminine.","cites":[2,3,4,5,8,9,12]},{"text":"Several reviewers say the soap is moisturizing and leaves skin soft and clean.","cites":[2,4,5,15]},{"text":"Some reviewers complain the scent is weak or smells like chemicals rather than lavender.","cites":[7,10,14]},{"text":"A few reviewers highlight its antibacterial cleaning power, including clearing acne.","cites":[6,13]},{"text":"A few reviewers report negative experiences such as skin feeling dry or rubbery, awkward shape, or melted/torn packaging.","cites":[1,11,15]}]},"qa":[]}